-- Windows Recall Feature Enabled - DisableAIDataAnalysis Value Deleted | T1113 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_delete/registry_delete_enable_windows_recall.yml | NOTA: fallback QRadarAQL_payload_pipeline: campos sem propriedade DSM mapeada são buscados em UTF8(payload) – custo maior, crie custom properties
SELECT * FROM events WHERE devicetype=12 AND LOWER(UTF8(payload)) LIKE '%deletevalue%' AND (LOWER("Process Name") LIKE '%\microsoft\windows\windowsai\disableaidataanalysis' OR LOWER("Target Process Name") LIKE '%\microsoft\windows\windowsai\disableaidataanalysis' OR LOWER("Object Name") LIKE '%\microsoft\windows\windowsai\disableaidataanalysis')
